     A faction's <licences> lists what THAT faction holds, with factions=
     naming the issuers — so the player's own block is the one that matters.
     The mirror spelling (a non-player faction listing "player" among the
     holders) is here too because the parser tolerates it; it does not occur
     in any of the 200 archived saves. -->
